  - id: E039
    channel: "\u6307\u6325\u5B98 / FLEET COMMAND"
    role: commander
    text: "\u5141\u8BB8\u5728\u6307\u5B9A\u5C04\u754C\u5185\u5F00\u706B\u3002\u4FDD\u6301\u64A4\u79BB\u8DEF\u7EBF\u7545\u901A\u3002\u90BB\u8230\u4E2D\u5F39\u65F6\u5148\u79FB\u52A8\uFF0C\u80FD\u591F\u901A\u4FE1\u540E\u518D\u62A5\u544A\u3002"
    english: Weapons free within your assigned lanes. Keep your escape route clear.
      If your neighbor is hit, move first and report when you can.
    time: 366.65216
    duration: 8.466458
    cameraShot: 3
    stage: 3
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9162e18362e7c5f409fef3f909c5b22d, type: 3}
